error[NK2111]: This `async { … }` starts no task, so it waits for nothing.
  --> tests/async_group_starts_no_task.nika:9:2
   |
 9 | 	async {
   |  ^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: Its statements run in order, as any block's; only an `async` inside it starts a task its end waits for.
   = help: Remove the word `async`. For one task of several steps, write `async fn { … }`.

